cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you cite a note from this repository, cite the note by title and date; the canonical text is the article at gancor.xyz."
title: "Letters: technical and empirical notes"
abstract: >-
  Short technical, empirical, and walkthrough notes on concentrated liquidity
  microstructure, set in the preprint stack of the surrounding research
  programme. Each note is the typeset form of an article published at
  gancor.xyz, which remains the canonical text. The notes are not preprints
  and carry no SSRN listing; this repository is their citable, archival copy,
  carrying the note PDFs and the code behind their numbers.
authors:
  - family-names: Ryan
    given-names: K. R.
    alias: Gancor
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0004-6295-7040"
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/g4nc0r/letters"
url: "https://gancor.xyz"
keywords:
  - concentrated liquidity
  - automated market maker
  - DeFi
  - loss-versus-rebalancing
  - emissions
  - ve(3,3)
